OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain at first,
OL,6,Fpossibly heavy at times. This will
OL,7,Fslowly clear to the south during the
OL,8,Fmorning, to leave a mostly dry
OL,9,Fafternoon. Blustery westerly winds
OL,10,Fexpected.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry with clear skies
OL,13,Fdeveloping. The blustery winds will
OL,14,Fstart to ease through the evening,
OL,15,Fthough stronger gusts are possible
OL,16,Falong the coast.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FGenerally fine and dry with
OL,19,Fsunny spells. Winds easing further to
OL,20,Fbecome light by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
