OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,6,Fwarm Sunday, with isolated showers.
OL,7,FDry on Monday, with a band of
OL,8,Fpotentially heavy rain and strong
OL,9,Fwinds moving in during the evening.
OL,10,FRain and strong winds for Tuesday.
